config OPENCORE_AAC
	bool "OpenCORE AAC decoder"
	help
	  Fixed-point AAC-LC decoder of the OpenCORE multimedia framework
	  (west project modules/lib/opencore, Apache-2.0). Integer only, no
	  libm. AAC_PLUS is not defined in this build, so the SBR and PS tools
	  of HE-AAC are not decoded. The decoder sources are C written in .cpp
	  files and are built as C.
